	<h2>What Is Conversion Rate Optimisation?</h2>

	<p>
		CRO is the systematic process of increasing the percentage of website visitors who complete a purchase, form fill, or other desired action. Unlike traditional marketing that focuses on driving more traffic, CRO maximizes the value of the visitors you already have.
	</p>

	<p><strong>The ROI math is simple:</strong><br />
	If you're spending $50,000/month on ads driving 10,000 visitors at a 2% conversion rate, you get 200 customers. Improve to 4% and you double to 400 customers – without spending an extra dollar on advertising.</p>

